{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04878","headline":"从猎渭川献诗 · 魏知古","name":"从猎渭川献诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻夏太康，五弟训禽荒。\n我后来冬狩，三驱盛礼张。\n顺时鹰隼击，讲事武功扬。\n奔走未及去，翾飞岂暇翔。\n非熊从渭水，瑞翟想陈仓。\n此欲诚难纵，兹游不可常。\n子云陈羽猎，僖伯谏渔棠。\n得失鉴齐楚，仁思念禹汤。\n雍熙亮在宥，亭毒匪多伤。\n辛甲今爲史，虞箴遂孔彰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏知古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}